{
  "title": "Security Group · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "리소스에 허용할 네트워크 연결을 규칙으로 지정합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Security Group</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#guide-1\">인바운드와 아웃바운드 규칙</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#guide-2\">계층 간 접근 제어</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>48 / 62</span></div><h1>Security Group</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>보안 그룹은 <strong>EC2나 데이터베이스 같은 리소스에 허용할 네트워크 통신을 정하는 가상 방화벽</strong>입니다. 예를 들어 웹 서버에는 HTTPS를, 데이터베이스에는 애플리케이션 서버의 접속만 허용할 수 있습니다.</p><p>보안 그룹은 상태 저장 방식<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>으로 동작합니다. 허용된 요청에 대한 응답은 연결 상태를 바탕으로 자동 허용됩니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"inbound-rules\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"outbound-rules\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"stateful-connection-tracking\"></span><h2>인바운드와 아웃바운드 규칙</h2><p><strong>인바운드</strong>는 리소스로 들어오는 연결, <strong>아웃바운드</strong>는 리소스에서 시작하는 연결의 허용 조건입니다. 프로토콜, 포트, 상대방의 IP 범위나 보안 그룹 등을 지정합니다.</p><p>규칙은 허용할 통신을 추가하는 방식입니다. 여러 보안 그룹을 연결하면 각 그룹의 허용 규칙이 합쳐집니다. 필요 이상으로 넓은 주소 범위를 허용하지 않도록 구성합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"security-group-referencing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"default-security-group\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"vpc-association-and-exceptions\"></span><h2>계층 간 접근 제어</h2><p>데이터베이스 보안 그룹의 접속 출처로 애플리케이션 보안 그룹을 지정하면, 서버의 개별 IP를 나열하지 않고 접근을 관리할 수 있습니다. 참조는 상대 그룹의 규칙을 복사하는 기능은 아닙니다.</p><p>보안 그룹으로 허용했더라도 라우팅과 NACL 설정이 맞아야 통신할 수 있습니다. 연결 장애를 확인할 때는 주소, 경로, 포트, 보안 규칙 순서로 살펴봅니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>서비스 계층별 연결 허용</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>로드 밸런서</strong><span>사용자의 HTTPS 허용</span></li><li><strong>앱 서버</strong><span>로드 밸런서의 접속 허용</span></li><li><strong>데이터베이스</strong><span>앱 서버의 DB 접속 허용</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">각 리소스는 실제로 통신해야 하는 상대와 포트만 허용합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>웹 서버가 늘어나도 데이터베이스 규칙을 매번 수정하지 않도록, DB 포트의 허용 출처를 웹 서버들의 보안 그룹으로 지정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>상태 저장 방식</strong> — 허용된 연결의 상태를 추적해 응답 트래픽을 구분하는 방식입니다. 응답을 위한 반대 방향 규칙을 별도로 추가하지 않아도 됩니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/vpc-security-groups.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Control traffic to your AWS resources using security groups ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q009\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q012\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q012\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q012</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which logical networking resource associated with an EC2 instance includes IP addresses and security groups?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>에는 프라이빗 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a> 등의 네트워크 속성이 연결된다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q013\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q013\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q013</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q013/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A security group allows inbound TCP port 443. Must a separate outbound rule allow response packets for that connection?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q013\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">No. Security groups are stateful, so responses to allowed traffic are permitted</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q013\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. A network ACL automatically modifies the security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q013\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, but only when a NAT gateway exists</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q013\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, always</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>는 상태 저장이다. 다만 별도의 새 아웃바운드 연결은 아웃바운드 규칙을 따진다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q014\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q014\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q014</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q014/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to explicitly deny traffic from a source IP range across an entire subnet. Which control should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q014\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A deny rule in a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q014\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q014\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A deny rule in a security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q014\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI attribute</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a> 수준에서 명시적 거부를 지원하며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>는 허용 규칙만 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q070\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q070\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q070</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q070/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to evaluate whether security group configurations remain compliant and track configuration changes. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q070\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q070\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q070\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q070\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Config</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">Config</a>는 리소스 구성 기록과 규정 준수 평가를 돕는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">이전 용어 <b>Secrets Manager</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">다음 용어 <b>Snowball Edge</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
